Republican organizations and vendors. The Fort&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.960
Worth Star-Telegram reported the move prompted a&nbsp;
comment from the national Log Cabin Republicans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:03.360
