It's clear that inclusion wins, which makes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:07.840
Texas Republican Party leadership's decision to&nbsp;
exclude the Texas Log Cabin Republicans from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:14.160
convention not just narrow minded, but politically&nbsp;
shortsighted, President Charles Moran said in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:20.240
statement citing former President Donald Trump's&nbsp;
support of the LGBTQ Republicans. So that Charles.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:29.920
His name is Rand. It just doesn't say more on&nbsp;
Moran is correct that this is narrow minded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.520
and short sighted by the Republican Party. But it&nbsp;
bothers me because even though in this situation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.720
I don't at all think that his organization should&nbsp;
have been banned from participating in that event.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:46.640
He should have known that that's the party&nbsp;
he's been supporting for all of these years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:52.000
He and his organization do this shameful thing&nbsp;
where they give legitimacy to the outrageous&nbsp;&nbsp;

